				/..VOLUME SIZES LESS THAN SIZE OF FLOPPY/A083
	JMP	CPYSKP		/ERR RET..ILLEGAL BLK NUM. SKIP THIS BLOCK/A083
/D070	JMS	FMTQRX 		/ QUEUE THE REQUEST			/A038
	JMS	FMTRXT		/ QUEUE THE REQUEST W/O CHECKING TIME	/A070
				/  AS A TIME CHECK IS DONE AT THE BEGIN	/A070
				/  OF THE SECTOR LOOP (CPYLP1)		/A070
	JMP	FMTER		/ ERROR--GO DISPLAY MESSAGE; WAIT FOR GM/A045
CPYSKP,									/A083
	ISZ	T1		/ BUMP THE SECTOR COUNTER		/C032
