		RXER12+4000	/ CODE FOR PHYSICAL READ 12 BIT MODE	/A032
	TAD	FMTBUF+2	/ GET WORD WHICH CONTAINS 'SYSTEM' BIT	/A032
	AND	(20		/ MASK OFF ALL OTHER BITS		/A032
