/									/
/	DRVTST--SKIP IF EITHER DRIVE IS DRIVE ZERO AND 0 NOT=WINNIE VOL./
/		CALLING SEQUENCE:					/
/		JMS DRVTST	/SKIP IF EITHER DRIVE IS DRIVE 0	/
/		JMP SOMEPLACE	/RETURNS HERE IF NEITHER 		/
/		...		/RETURNS HERE IF EITHER, OR 0=WINNIE	/
